<h2>Reporting a mistake</h2>
<p>To get a quick fix, please include:</p>
<ul>
  <li>the <strong>character</strong> (name and card code, for example DBL99-01L) or the <strong>equipment</strong> concerned;</li>
  <li>what the tool shows and what you see <strong>in game</strong> (a screenshot helps a lot);</li>
  <li>the <strong>team lineup</strong> you used, if the issue involves a condition or a total.</li>
</ul>
<p>Data fixes are included in the next update.</p>

<h2>Other requests</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Suggestions</strong> — a missing feature, a guide to write: every idea is read.</li>
  <li><strong>Privacy</strong> — for questions about your data, please check the <a href="/en/privacy.html">privacy policy</a> first.</li>
  <li><strong>Copyright</strong> — if you own the rights to content shown on the site and want it removed, write to us: the request will be handled promptly.</li>
</ul>
<p>Messages are only used to reply to you and are never shared.</p>
